#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:446
msgid ""
":math:`\\Delta=0` では電子がAとBに1個ずつ分かれ、:math:`\\Delta` が大きいほど電子はAに移る。 "
":math:`\\Delta/t\\ge1` の範囲で同じ :math:`\\Delta` で比べると、交替鎖の :math:`N_B` "
"は2準位模型より大きい。:math:`\\Delta\\gg t` でこうなるのは、 各Aが2つのBと結合しており、:eq:`pd-moment`"
" の広がり :math:`\\langle|h(k)|^2\\rangle=2t^2` が2準位模型の2倍 だからである。実際、:eq:`pd-"
"ionic-limit` の :math:`t^2` を :math:`2t^2` に置き換えると、 :math:`\\Delta\\gg t` "
"での近似 :math:`N_B\\simeq4t^2/\\Delta^2` が得られ、:math:`\\Delta/t=8` では "
"交替鎖の値に近い。"
msgstr ""
"At :math:`\\Delta=0`, A and B each receive one electron. As "
":math:`\\Delta` increases, electrons shift toward A. For "
":math:`\\Delta/t\\ge1`, at the same :math:`\\Delta`, the alternating "
"chain has a larger :math:`N_B` than the two-level model. When "
":math:`\\Delta\\gg t`, this occurs because each A couples to two B atoms "
"and the spread from Equation :eq:`pd-moment`, "
":math:`\\langle|h(k)|^2\\rangle=2t^2`, is twice that of the two-level "
"model. Indeed, using Equation :eq:`pd-ionic-limit` with :math:`t^2` "
"replaced by :math:`2t^2` gives, for :math:`\\Delta\\gg t`, the "
"approximation :math:`N_B\\simeq4t^2/\\Delta^2`, and at "
":math:`\\Delta/t=8` it is close to the value for the alternating chain."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:453
msgid ""
":math:`\\Delta` が小さいと、大小は逆になる。:math:`\\Delta/t=0.1` では交替鎖の :math:`N_B` "
"が0.919、2準位模型が0.950で、 両者は :math:`\\Delta/t\\approx0.88` "
"で等しくなる。交替鎖では、価電子帯の上端 :math:`ka=\\pi` の近くで :math:`|h(k)|` が :math:`t` "
"より小さくなり、 そこの状態のBの重みは2準位模型より小さく、上端ではAだけになる。:math:`\\Delta` "
"が小さいと、この上端付近の寄与が、 平均の広がりが大きいことの効果を上回る。"
msgstr ""
"For small :math:`\\Delta`, the order reverses. At :math:`\\Delta/t=0.1`, "
":math:`N_B` is 0.919 in the alternating chain and 0.950 in the two-level "
"model. The values coincide at :math:`\\Delta/t\\approx0.88`. In the "
"alternating chain, near the valence band maximum at :math:`ka=\\pi`, "
":math:`|h(k)|` is smaller than :math:`t`, so the states there have less "
"weight on B than in the two-level model. At the maximum, the state is "
"entirely A. For small :math:`\\Delta`, the contribution from near the "
"band maximum outweighs the effect of the larger average spread."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:458
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ぼかした曲線を積分して :math:`N_A` や :math:`N_B` を求めると、積分の上限によって値が変わる。 "
":math:`\\Delta/t=4` の占有されたAの重みは :math:`N_A=2-N_B=1.835` である。ぼかした "
":math:`2\\tilde\\rho_A` を :math:`E_{\\mathrm v}` "
"まで積分すると、:math:`\\sigma=0.1t` で1.665、 :math:`\\sigma=0.4t` "
"で1.456となり、正しい値より小さい。:math:`E_{\\mathrm v}` にはAの重みが "
"集まっていて、その山の上側の裾が窓の外に出るからである。ギャップの中央まで積分すると、 "
"どちらの幅でも小数第3位まで1.835に一致する。ギャップの半分（:math:`2t`）が :math:`\\sigma` の5倍以上あり、 "
"ギャップの中央を越えて出入りする裾が小さいからである。:math:`\\sigma=t` では1.817となり、ずれが見えてくる。 "
"電子数を厳密に求めるには、ぼかす前の固有状態の重みを、:eq:`pd-population` のように占有した状態について直接足す。"
msgstr ""
"When :math:`N_A` or :math:`N_B` is obtained by integrating a broadened "
"curve, its value depends on the upper integration limit. For "
":math:`\\Delta/t=4`, the occupied weight on A is :math:`N_A=2-N_B=1.835`."
" Integrating the broadened :math:`2\\tilde\\rho_A` up to "
":math:`E_{\\mathrm v}` gives 1.665 at :math:`\\sigma=0.1t` and 1.456 at "
":math:`\\sigma=0.4t`, both below the correct value. The weight on A is "
"concentrated at :math:`E_{\\mathrm v}`, so the upper tail of that peak "
"extends beyond the window. Integrating to the middle of the gap gives "
"1.835 to three decimal places at both widths. Half the gap (:math:`2t`) "
"is at least five times :math:`\\sigma`, so little weight crosses the "
"middle of the gap in the Gaussian tails. At :math:`\\sigma=t`, the result"
" is 1.817 and the discrepancy becomes apparent. To obtain the exact "
"electron population, sum the unbroadened weights of the occupied "
"eigenstates directly, as in Equation :eq:`pd-population`."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:467
msgid ""
"同じ読み方は、実際の酸化物の計算にも使える。 `BaTiO₃の二重井戸ポテンシャル Part 2 <https://example.quloud-"
"platform.quemix.com/BaTiO3/total-energy.html#batio3-mode-dos>`__ "
"では、OpenMXのLDA（CA19）と局在基底（PAO）で、5原子の立方晶BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ と、極性 "
"ソフトモードに沿って原子をずらした構造のPDOSを、ガウス関数でぼかし、各構造の価電子帯上端を0に揃えて比べている。主にO "
"2pからなる価電子帯に、Ti 3dの重みが有限に現れる。形式的な 酸化数ではTi\\ :sup:`4+`\\ "
"はd電子を持たないが、交替鎖でAに電子が移っても :math:`N_B` が0に ならないのと同じく、Ti 3dとO "
"2pの混成によって占有状態にTi 3dの重みが残る。Cohenは、 このTi 3d–O 2pの混成がBaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ "
"とPbTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ の強誘電不安定性に欠かせないことを 示した "
"[PdosCohen1992]_。ただし実際の物質では1原子に複数の軌道があり、PAO基底への射影の "
"仕方も模型と異なるので、模型の数値と事例の数値を直接比べることはできない。"
msgstr ""
"The same approach can be used to interpret calculations for real oxides. "
"The calculation example `Double-Well Potential of BaTiO₃, Part 2 "
"<https://example.quloud-platform.quemix.com/BaTiO3/total-"
"energy.html#batio3-mode-dos>`__ uses OpenMX with LDA (CA19) and a "
"localized basis (PAO) to compare the PDOS of five-atom cubic BaTiO\\ "
":sub:`3` \\ with that of a structure in which the atoms have been "
"displaced along a polar soft mode. The curves are broadened with a "
"Gaussian and each structure's valence band maximum is set to zero. The "
"predominantly O 2p valence band has a finite Ti 3d weight. In terms of "
"its formal oxidation state, Ti\\ :sup:`4+` \\ has no d electrons, but "
"hybridization between Ti 3d and O 2p leaves Ti 3d weight in occupied "
"states, just as :math:`N_B` remains nonzero in the alternating chain even"
" when electrons shift onto A. Cohen showed that the ferroelectric "
"instability of BaTiO\\ :sub:`3` \\ and PbTiO\\ :sub:`3` \\ requires this "
"Ti 3d–O 2p hybridization [PdosCohen1992]_. However, in the real material "
"each atom has multiple orbitals and the projection onto the PAO basis "
"differs from the projection used in the model, so values from the model "
"and the calculation example cannot be compared directly."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:478
msgid "解釈と限界"
msgstr "Interpretation and Limitations"

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:480
msgid ""
"PDOSは観測量ではなく、基底の取り方に依存する。:ref:`Löwdin電子数<lowdin>` と同じく、 "
"状態の重みをどの原子に割り当てるかは、原子軌道の広がり、直交化の方法（Mulliken型かLöwdin型か）、射影の完全さ（spilling "
"parameter）で変わる。PDOSは、同じ方法・同じ基底で 得た結果どうしで比べる。"
msgstr ""
"The PDOS is not an observable and depends on the choice of basis. As with"
" :ref:`Löwdin populations <lowdin>`, the assignment of a state's weight "
"to individual atoms depends on the spatial extent of the atomic orbitals,"
" the method of orthogonalization (Mulliken-type or Löwdin-type), and the "
"completeness of the projection, indicated by the spilling parameter. "
"Compare PDOS results obtained with the same method and basis."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:484
msgid ""
"PDOSを占有状態で積分して得られるのは、:eq:`pd-population` のとおりLöwdin電子数やMulliken電子数であり、 "
"形式的な酸化数から数えた電子数ではない。遷移金属イオンの形式的な酸化数を "
"変えても、イオンの近くの電子数はほとんど変わらないことが計算で示されている "
"[PdosRaebiger2008]_。また、PDOSの重みは混成の行列要素そのものでもない。2準位模型の :eq:`pd-dimer-w` "
"が示すとおり、重みは :math:`t/\\Delta` の比と結合する相手の数で 決まり、山が重なることだけでは混成の有無も決まらない。"
msgstr ""
"As Equation :eq:`pd-population` shows, integrating the PDOS over occupied"
" states gives the Löwdin population or the Mulliken population, not an "
"electron count derived from the formal oxidation state. Calculations have"
" shown that changing the formal oxidation state of a transition-metal ion"
" hardly changes the number of electrons near that ion "
"[PdosRaebiger2008]_. The PDOS weight is also distinct from the "
"hybridization matrix element itself. As Equation :eq:`pd-dimer-w` for the"
" two-level model illustrates, the weight depends on the ratio "
":math:`t/\\Delta` and on the number of coupling partners. Peak overlap "
"alone cannot establish whether hybridization occurs."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:490
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"構造ごとに価電子帯上端で揃えた図では、基準そのものが構造とともに動く。揃えた図での 重心の移動は :math:`E_{\\mathrm v}` "
"の移動を含み、全エネルギーの分解としても読めない （:ref:`pdos-energy-alignment`）。"
msgstr ""
"In plots aligned to each structure's valence band maximum, the reference "
"itself moves with the structure. A centroid shift in an aligned plot "
"includes the shift of :math:`E_{\\mathrm v}` and cannot be interpreted as"
" a contribution to the total energy (see :ref:`pdos-energy-alignment`)."

#: ../../electronic/pdos.rst:494
msgid ""
"ぼかした曲線から窓を切って求めた量は、:math:`\\sigma` と窓の取り方に依存する。裾の出入りは "
"重みの集まるバンド端やピークで大きいので、窓の端がそこにかかると値が大きく変わる。 "
"数値を示すときは、ぼかしの関数と幅の定義、窓の範囲も併せて書く。"
msgstr ""
"A quantity obtained from a broadened curve over an energy window depends "
"on :math:`\\sigma` and on the choice of window. The largest transfers of "
"weight across the window edges occur near band edges or peaks where the "
"weight is concentrated, so the value can change substantially when a "
"window edge falls there. When reporting numerical values, also specify "
"the broadening function, how its width is defined, and the bounds of the "
"window."

